#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0210 expect=skipped domain=ADSL
#note "MECHANISM PIN - NO DM block at all. ⭐ Rewritten 2026-09-10 (R-4.12 hoist, owner ruling, PLAN-qualified-requirements-cross-standard §8.4): with the guard in Requirements.Variables.All [DM.ARM], KeyMatchRowExpander still skips the join entry (rows kept), but the qualified requirement cannot be satisfied — DM is not available — so the rule reports an auditable SKIP naming the dataset. Previously the authored dotted guard let it EXECUTE and report nothing. This fixture is what the hoist buys: the absent dependency is now visible in the report."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADSL structure=ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col ARM     type=Char
